IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg7-governing-provisions`
IMPORT `dg7-nonstock-mergers`

-- Tests of dg7-nonstock-mergers.l4 (8 Del. C. ss 255 to 258).
-- Every expected value is decided here from the text of ss 255 to 258 (src:1172-1228), then compared with the rule's answer.

§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of corporation`
      w IS A `Where an entity is formed`
GIVETH A `dg7 Constituent corporation`
`test a constituent that is` k w MEANS
    `dg7 Constituent corporation` WITH
        `kind of corporation` IS k
        `where the corporation is formed` IS w

`test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `this State`
`test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` `this State`
`test a Delaware charitable nonstock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `this State`
`test a Delaware stock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a stock corporation` `this State`
`test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `another jurisdiction of the United States`
`test a Nevada-style stock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a stock corporation` `another jurisdiction of the United States`
`test a foreign-country nonstock corporation` MEANS `test a constituent that is` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` `a foreign jurisdiction outside the United States`

GIVEN terms IS A BOOLEAN
      mode IS A BOOLEAN
      amendments IS A BOOLEAN
      attachment IS A BOOLEAN
      converted IS A BOOLEAN
      manner IS A BOOLEAN
      notOutstanding IS A BOOLEAN
      consideration IS A BOOLEAN
      surrender IS A BOOLEAN
      cashInLieu IS A BOOLEAN
      consistent IS A BOOLEAN
      foreign IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg7 Agreement of merger or consolidation`
`test an agreement with` terms mode amendments attachment converted manner notOutstanding consideration surrender cashInLieu consistent foreign MEANS
    `dg7 Agreement of merger or consolidation` WITH
        `states the terms and conditions of the merger or consolidation` IS terms
        `states the mode of carrying the merger or consolidation into effect` IS mode
        `states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that it shall be its certificate of incorporation` IS amendments
        `states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the agreement` IS attachment
        `some shares, memberships or membership interests are to be converted or cancelled` IS converted
        `states the manner of converting or cancelling them` IS manner
        `some shares, memberships or membership interests are not to remain outstanding` IS notOutstanding
        `states the cash, property, rights or securities the holders are to receive in exchange for them` IS consideration
        `states the surrender of any certificates evidencing the shares, memberships or membership interests` IS surrender
        `provides for the payment of cash in lieu of fractional shares, rights or other securities, or some other arrangement` IS cashInLieu
        `that provision is consistent with s 155` IS consistent
        `states the provisions or facts the laws of each foreign jurisdiction require in an agreement of merger or consolidation` IS foreign

-- A complete merger agreement: terms, mode, amendments statement, manner, consideration, surrender, foreign-law statements; no cash in lieu.
`test a complete merger agreement` MEANS `test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
`test a merger` MEANS `a merger into a surviving corporation that is one of the constituent corporations`
`test a consolidation` MEANS `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation formed by the consolidation`

§ `s 255(a) -- who may merge or consolidate`

-- Two nonstock corporations of this State, whether or not organized for profit: a merger into one of them.
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` `test a Delaware charitable nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` `test a Delaware stock corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporation is a nonstock corporation of this State` `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE
-- "2 or more": one corporation is not enough.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- Three are fine.
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware charitable nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE
-- A stock corporation, or a corporation of another jurisdiction, among them: not under this section.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- A merger needs a surviving corporation that is one of the constituents.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a merger` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- A consolidation needs a new resulting nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT `s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a consolidation` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a consolidation` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- The agreement must comply and be approved in accordance with the section.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE FALSE)

§ `s 255(b) -- the agreement`

#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` `test a complete merger agreement`
-- Each statement is needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- A merger needs the amendments statement; the attachment statement is for a consolidation.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a consolidation` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a consolidation` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Item (5): where memberships are converted or cancelled the manner must be stated.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Nothing converted or cancelled: no manner to state.
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- Item (5): where some memberships do not remain outstanding, the consideration must be stated.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Item (6): a cash-in-lieu provision must be consistent with s 155.
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))

-- Execution: by an authorized person; if filed, executed and acknowledged in accordance with s 103.
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement has been executed as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the agreement has been executed as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement has been executed as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) the agreement has been executed as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE)

-- Terms may depend on facts outside the agreement if the manner is clearly and expressly set forth.
#ASSERT `s 255(b) a term of the agreement may be made dependent upon facts ascertainable outside the agreement` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(b) a term of the agreement may be made dependent upon facts ascertainable outside the agreement` FALSE)

-- The sentence defining "facts" (ss 255(b), 256(b), 257(b), fork F-facts-1): "includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event,
-- including a determination or action by any person or body, including the corporation". The three it names are facts; for anything else the
-- sentence does not say, because "includes, but is not limited to" leaves the list open: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the thing is a fact in the sense of the sentence that defines facts` `the occurrence of an event` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the thing is a fact in the sense of the sentence that defines facts` `a determination by a person or body, including the corporation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the thing is a fact in the sense of the sentence that defines facts` `an action by a person or body, including the corporation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(b) the thing is a fact in the sense of the sentence that defines facts` `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 255(c) -- notice, vote, certification and effect`

-- Owed notice: a member with the right to vote for the governing body, or one entitled to vote on the merger.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the member is owed notice of the meeting` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the member is owed notice of the meeting` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the member is owed notice of the meeting` FALSE FALSE)

-- Meeting on 31 March 2026: 20 days before is 11 March 2026.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the latest date for the notice of the meeting` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 3 11
-- Meeting on 10 March 2026: 20 days before is 18 February 2026.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the latest date for the notice of the meeting` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 10) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 2 18

GIVEN given IS A DATE
      meeting IS A DATE
      time IS A BOOLEAN
      place IS A BOOLEAN
      purpose IS A BOOLEAN
      copy IS A BOOLEAN
      summary IS A BOOLEAN
      address IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 255(c) Notice of the meeting`
`test a notice of the meeting with` given meeting time place purpose copy summary address MEANS
    `s 255(c) Notice of the meeting` WITH
        `the date the notice was given` IS given
        `the date of the meeting` IS meeting
        `the notice states the time of the meeting` IS time
        `the notice states the place of the meeting` IS place
        `the notice states the purpose of the meeting` IS purpose
        `the notice contains a copy of the agreement` IS copy
        `the notice contains a brief summary of the agreement` IS summary
        `the notice was sent to the member's address as it appears on the records of the corporation` IS address

-- Given on the 20th day before the meeting (11 March for 31 March): in time. A day later: not.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 12) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- A brief summary is enough instead of a copy.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- Neither copy nor summary.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Time, place, purpose and the member's address on the records are each needed.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the notice satisfies the subsection` (`test a notice of the meeting with` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 3 31) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))

-- The vote: a majority of all the members entitled to vote. 51 of 100 carries; 50 of 100 is not a majority.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 100 51 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 100 50 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 7 4 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 7 3 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: no members entitled to vote, or more votes for than members.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the members of the corporation have adopted the agreement` 100 101 EQUALS NOTHING

-- Certification by the officer who performs the secretary's duties, unless a certificate of merger is filed in lieu.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the adoption has been certified as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the adoption has been certified as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the adoption has been certified as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE)

-- The last sentence of s 251(c), read with member for stockholder.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of the last sentence of s 251(c)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of the last sentence of s 251(c)` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(c) the person is a stockholder for the purposes of the last sentence of s 251(c)` FALSE FALSE)

-- Effective when adopted and certified by each constituent corporation, at the time s 103 gives.
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the date on which the merger or consolidation becomes effective` (LIST TRUE, TRUE) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1)
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the date on which the merger or consolidation becomes effective` (LIST TRUE, FALSE) (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 255(c) the date on which the merger or consolidation becomes effective` EMPTY (YearMonthDay 2026 9 1) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 255(d) -- a corporation whose only voting members are the governing body`

-- Five members of the governing body: a majority of all of them is 3 or more.
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 5 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 5 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Four members: 2 is half, not a majority; 3 is.
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 4 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 4 3 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- If other members have a vote, subsection (d) does not apply.
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` FALSE 5 5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: no members of the governing body, or more adopting than there are.
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 255(d) the governing body alone has approved the agreement` TRUE 5 6 EQUALS NOTHING

GIVEN resolution IS A BOOLEAN
      onlyGoverningBody IS A BOOLEAN
      gbTotal IS A NUMBER
      gbAdopted IS A NUMBER
      entitled IS A NUMBER
      forAdoption IS A NUMBER
      certified IS A BOOLEAN
      inLieu IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg7 s 255 Approval by one constituent corporation`
`test an approval with` resolution onlyGoverningBody gbTotal gbAdopted entitled forAdoption certified inLieu MEANS
    `dg7 s 255 Approval by one constituent corporation` WITH
        `the governing body adopted a resolution approving the agreement` IS resolution
        `no member other than the members of the governing body themselves has the right to vote for the election of the members of the governing body or for the merger` IS onlyGoverningBody
        `the number of members of the governing body` IS gbTotal
        `the number of members of the governing body who adopted the resolution` IS gbAdopted
        `the number of members entitled to vote on the agreement` IS entitled
        `the number of those members who voted for adoption` IS forAdoption
        `the adoption was certified on the agreement by the officer who performs the duties of the secretary` IS certified
        `a certificate of merger or consolidation is filed in lieu of filing the agreement` IS inLieu

§ `s 255 -- approval by one constituent corporation`

-- Voting members: resolution, 51 of 100 for adoption, certified: approved.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` TRUE FALSE 5 5 100 51 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Same, but 50 of 100: not approved.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` TRUE FALSE 5 5 100 50 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No governing-body resolution: not approved.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` FALSE FALSE 5 5 100 90 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not certified and no certificate filed in lieu: not approved.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` TRUE FALSE 5 5 100 90 FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not certified, but a certificate of merger filed in lieu: approved.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` TRUE FALSE 5 5 100 90 FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Governing body alone (subsection (d)): 3 of 5, certified; the voting counts are not looked at.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` FALSE TRUE 5 3 0 0 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` FALSE TRUE 5 2 0 0 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` FALSE TRUE 5 3 0 0 FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: the counts cannot be a vote.
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` TRUE FALSE 5 5 0 0 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 255 the constituent corporation has approved the agreement` (`test an approval with` FALSE TRUE 0 0 0 0 TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 255(e), (f) -- provisions of s 251 brought in`

#ASSERT `s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `the last sentence of s 251(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`
#ASSERT `s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(d), terminating or amending the agreement before it becomes effective`
#ASSERT `s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 252(d), the appointment of the Secretary of State to receive process`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `the last sentence of s 252(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement`)

-- The references of s 251(d) are read for a nonstock corporation as the governing body, members, memberships or membership interests.
#ASSERT `s 255(e) the reference in s 251(d) is read for a constituent nonstock corporation as` `a reference to the board of directors` EQUALS `a reference to the governing body of the corporation`
#ASSERT `s 255(e) the reference in s 251(d) is read for a constituent nonstock corporation as` `a reference to stockholders` EQUALS `a reference to members of the corporation`
#ASSERT `s 255(e) the reference in s 251(d) is read for a constituent nonstock corporation as` `a reference to shares` EQUALS `a reference to memberships or membership interests`

§ `s 255(g) -- the charitable limit`

-- A charitable nonstock corporation merged into a nonstock corporation with its charitable status lost or impaired: not authorized.
#ASSERT `s 255(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE
-- Charitable status not lost or impaired: the limit does not bite.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE)
-- A nonstock corporation that is not charitable merged into another: the limit does not bite.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE)
-- A consolidation is not mentioned by the limit.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a consolidation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE)
-- Into a stock corporation: the limit of s 255(g) is about a merger into a nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE)
-- "but a nonstock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation".
#ASSERT `s 255(g) a nonstock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `a charitable nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 255(g) a nonstock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` `a charitable nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) a nonstock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 255(g) a nonstock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a stock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation`)

§ `s 256(a) -- domestic with foreign nonstock corporations`

#ASSERT `s 256(a) a foreign nonstock corporation` `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 256(a) a foreign nonstock corporation` `test a foreign-country nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) a foreign nonstock corporation` `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) a foreign nonstock corporation` `test a Nevada-style stock corporation`)

#ASSERT `s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- Prohibited by the law of the foreign jurisdiction.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- Two domestic nonstock corporations: no foreign one, so not under this section.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware nonstock corporation with membership interests`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- Two foreign nonstock corporations: no domestic one.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Nevada-style nonstock corporation`, `test a foreign-country nonstock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- A stock corporation among them: that is s 258, not s 256.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Nevada-style stock corporation`) `test a merger` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- Consolidation into a new nonstock corporation of the jurisdiction of one of the constituents.
#ASSERT `s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a foreign-country nonstock corporation`) `test a consolidation` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a foreign-country nonstock corporation`) `test a consolidation` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)

§ `s 256(b) -- the agreement`

-- All the constituent corporations entered into an agreement; surviving corporation of this State; items (1) to (7).
#ASSERT `s 256(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` `test a complete merger agreement` TRUE TRUE
-- Items (3) and (4) bite only if the surviving or resulting corporation is a corporation of this State.
#ASSERT `s 256(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) TRUE TRUE)
-- Item (7): the provisions or facts the laws of each foreign jurisdiction require.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) TRUE TRUE)
-- Not every constituent corporation entered into it.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` `test a complete merger agreement` FALSE TRUE)

§ `s 256(c) -- approval, and the provisions brought in`

-- A foreign constituent: its own law. A Delaware constituent: the manner of s 255.
#ASSERT `s 256(c) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement as the subsection requires` (`s 256(c) Approval by one constituent corporation` WITH `where the corporation is formed` IS `another jurisdiction of the United States`, `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS TRUE, `it is a Delaware corporation and was approved in the same manner as s 255 provides` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(c) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement as the subsection requires` (`s 256(c) Approval by one constituent corporation` WITH `where the corporation is formed` IS `another jurisdiction of the United States`, `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS FALSE, `it is a Delaware corporation and was approved in the same manner as s 255 provides` IS TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 256(c) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement as the subsection requires` (`s 256(c) Approval by one constituent corporation` WITH `where the corporation is formed` IS `this State`, `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS TRUE, `it is a Delaware corporation and was approved in the same manner as s 255 provides` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(c) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement as the subsection requires` (`s 256(c) Approval by one constituent corporation` WITH `where the corporation is formed` IS `this State`, `the agreement was adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged in accordance with the laws under which it is organized` IS TRUE, `it is a Delaware corporation and was approved in the same manner as s 255 provides` IS FALSE))

`test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation` MEANS
    `dg7 Context of a provision brought in` WITH
        `it is a merger and not a consolidation` IS TRUE
        `the corporation surviving the merger is a corporation of this State` IS FALSE
        `the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation` IS TRUE
        `the constituent corporation concerned is a stock corporation of this State` IS FALSE
`test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation` MEANS
    `dg7 Context of a provision brought in` WITH
        `it is a merger and not a consolidation` IS TRUE
        `the corporation surviving the merger is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE
        `the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation` IS FALSE
        `the constituent corporation concerned is a stock corporation of this State` IS TRUE
`test a context of a consolidation of stock corporations` MEANS
    `dg7 Context of a provision brought in` WITH
        `it is a merger and not a consolidation` IS FALSE
        `the corporation surviving the merger is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE
        `the surviving or resulting corporation is a foreign corporation` IS FALSE
        `the constituent corporation concerned is a stock corporation of this State` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `the last sentence of s 252(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`
#ASSERT `s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(d), terminating or amending the agreement before it becomes effective` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`
-- s 251(e) only if the corporation surviving the merger is a corporation of this State.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`)
#ASSERT `s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `the last sentence of s 251(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`)

§ `s 256(d) -- service of process on the Secretary of State`

-- A surviving foreign nonstock corporation must agree to be served, irrevocably appoint the Secretary of State and specify an address.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the surviving or resulting foreign nonstock corporation has done what the subsection requires of it` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the surviving or resulting foreign nonstock corporation has done what the subsection requires of it` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the surviving or resulting foreign nonstock corporation has done what the subsection requires of it` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the surviving or resulting foreign nonstock corporation has done what the subsection requires of it` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- If the survivor is not a foreign nonstock corporation, the subsection asks nothing of it.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the surviving or resulting foreign nonstock corporation has done what the subsection requires of it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

-- Electronic service on the Secretary of State only as the Secretary of State prescribes.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the service of process on the Secretary of State is good` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the service of process on the Secretary of State is good` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the service of process on the Secretary of State is good` TRUE FALSE)

-- The letter goes to the address specified, or the last address designated in writing for the purpose.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the address to which the Secretary of State's letter must be directed` "1 Main Street" NOTHING EQUALS "1 Main Street"
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the address to which the Secretary of State's letter must be directed` "1 Main Street" (JUST "9 Side Street") EQUALS "9 Side Street"

#ASSERT `s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's letter to the corporation is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- The plaintiff's duty: duplicate papers, notice to the Secretary of State, and the fee.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of the plaintiff` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of the plaintiff` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of the plaintiff` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of the plaintiff` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- The fee is taxed as costs if the plaintiff prevails.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the fee is taxed as a part of the costs in the proceeding` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the fee is taxed as a part of the costs in the proceeding` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the fee is taxed as a part of the costs in the proceeding` FALSE TRUE)

#ASSERT `s 256(d) the Secretary of State's record of the service is as the subsection requires` (`s 256(d) Record of a service of process` WITH `the record is alphabetical` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the names of the plaintiff and defendant` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth that service has been effected pursuant to the subsection` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the return date` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the day and hour when the service was made` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State's record of the service is as the subsection requires` (`s 256(d) Record of a service of process` WITH `the record is alphabetical` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the names of the plaintiff and defendant` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the title, docket number and nature of the proceeding` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth that service has been effected pursuant to the subsection` IS TRUE, `the record sets forth the return date` IS FALSE, `the record sets forth the day and hour when the service was made` IS TRUE))

-- Not required to retain the record for longer than 5 years from receipt. Received 1 March 2026: the fifth anniversary is 1 March 2031.
#ASSERT `s 256(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of the service` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2031 3 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of the service` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2031 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of the service` (YearMonthDay 2026 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2028 6 1))

§ `s 256(g) -- the charitable limit`

#ASSERT `s 256(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 256(g) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE)

§ `s 257(a) -- stock with nonstock corporations of this State`

#ASSERT `s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`) TRUE
#ASSERT `s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware charitable nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`) TRUE
-- Two nonstock, or two stock corporations: not under this section.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware charitable nonstock corporation`) TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware stock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`) TRUE)
-- A corporation of another State: not "of this State".
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Nevada-style stock corporation`) TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(a) the corporations may merge or consolidate` (LIST `test a Delaware nonprofit nonstock corporation`, `test a Delaware stock corporation`) FALSE)
-- The surviving or resulting corporation may be of any of the four kinds.
#ASSERT `s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` `a stock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`
#ASSERT `s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`
#ASSERT `s 257(a) the surviving or resulting corporation may be of this kind` `a charitable nonstock corporation`

§ `s 257(b), (c) -- resolution, agreement, approval`

#ASSERT `s 257(b) the body that must adopt the resolution` `a stock corporation` EQUALS `the board of directors`
#ASSERT `s 257(b) the body that must adopt the resolution` `a charitable nonstock corporation` EQUALS `the governing body`
#ASSERT `s 257(b) the body that must adopt the resolution` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` EQUALS `the governing body`
#ASSERT `s 257(b) the body that must adopt the resolution` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` EQUALS `the governing body`

-- Item (5) of s 257(b) also asks for the surrender of certificates, where shares do not remain outstanding.
#ASSERT `s 257(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` `test a complete merger agreement`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- Nothing is left outstanding-less: no surrender to state.
#ASSERT `s 257(b) the agreement states what the subsection requires` `test a merger` (`test an agreement with` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

#ASSERT `s 257(c) the section whose manner of approval governs the constituent corporation` `a stock corporation` EQUALS `s 251, the section on stock corporations`
#ASSERT `s 257(c) the section whose manner of approval governs the constituent corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` EQUALS `s 255, the section on nonstock corporations`

-- s 257(c) to (e): the provisions brought in.
#ASSERT `s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `the last sentence of s 251(c), a certificate of merger or consolidation in lieu of filing the agreement` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(d), terminating or amending the agreement before it becomes effective` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(e), the automatic amendment of the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`
-- s 251(f) applies to any constituent stock corporation participating in a merger: not a consolidation, not a nonstock constituent.
#ASSERT `s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger` `test a context where the survivor is a Delaware corporation and the constituent is a stock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger` `test a context of a consolidation of stock corporations`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 251(f), no vote of the stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257 the provision applies to a merger under this section` `s 252(d), the appointment of the Secretary of State to receive process` `test a context where the survivor is a foreign corporation`)

§ `s 257(f) -- the charitable limit`

#ASSERT `s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` FALSE)
-- Into a nonstock corporation: that is s 255(g), not s 257(f).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a merger` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(f) this section does not authorize the merger` `test a consolidation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE)
-- "but a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which shall continue as the surviving corporation".
#ASSERT `s 257(f) a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a stock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(f) a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a stock corporation` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 257(f) a stock corporation may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation that continues as the surviving corporation` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` `a charitable nonstock corporation`)

§ `s 258 -- domestic with foreign stock and nonstock corporations`

#ASSERT `s 258(a) a foreign corporation` `test a Nevada-style stock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 258(a) a foreign corporation` `test a foreign-country nonstock corporation`
